        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Aligned with our business strategy, our human capital management strategy focuses on developing and delivering solutions to attract, develop, engage and retain top talent in each of the countries where we operate.",
        "start_character": 40887,
        "end_character": 41100
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001053507-26-000035",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001053507-26-000035-a6616eb675ead252",
        "accession_number": "0001053507-26-000035",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a critical investment in our capacity to provide our customers with outstanding support and customer service, we offer a variety of development opportunities unique to each market to cultivate our talent throughout our global organization.",
        "start_character": 41982,
        "end_character": 42224
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001053507-26-000035",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001053507-26-000035-a6616eb675ead252",
        "accession_number": "0001053507-26-000035",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the communications sites in our portfolio, we manage rooftop and tower sites for property owners under various contractual arrangements.",
        "start_character": 1618,
        "end_character": 1769
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001053507-26-000035",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001053507-26-000035-a6616eb675ead252",
        "accession_number": "0001053507-26-000035",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide management services to property owners in the United States who elect to retain full rights to their property while simultaneously marketing the rooftop for wireless communications equipment installation.",
        "start_character": 13895,
        "end_character": 14123
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001053507-26-000035",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001053507-26-000035-a6616eb675ead252",
        "accession_number": "0001053507-26-000035",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In certain of the markets in which we operate, we are required to provide tower space to service providers on a non-discriminatory basis, subject to the negotiation of mutually agreeable terms.",
        "start_character": 29233,
        "end_character": 29426
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001053507-26-000035",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001053507-26-000035-a6616eb675ead252",
        "accession_number": "0001053507-26-000035",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our portfolio primarily consists of towers that we own and towers that we operate pursuant to long-term lease arrangements, as well as distributed antenna system (“DAS”) networks, which provide seamless coverage solutions in certain in-building and outdoor wireless environments.",
        "start_character": 1338,
        "end_character": 1617
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001053507-26-000035",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001053507-26-000035-a6616eb675ead252",
        "accession_number": "0001053507-26-000035",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "This includes investing in our systems and people as we strive to improve efficiency and provide superior service to our customers.",
        "start_character": 21823,
        "end_character": 21954
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001053507-26-000035",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001053507-26-000035-a6616eb675ead252",
        "accession_number": "0001053507-26-000035",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also hold other telecommunications infrastructure, fiber and property interests that we lease primarily to communications service providers and third-party tower operators, and, as discussed further below, we hold a portfolio of highly interconnected data center facilities and related assets in the United States that we provide for the leasing of space primarily to enterprises, network operators, cloud providers and supporting service providers.",
        "start_character": 1770,
        "end_character": 2222
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001053507-26-000035",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001053507-26-000035-a6616eb675ead252",
        "accession_number": "0001053507-26-000035",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer tower-related services in the United States, which we refer to as our services operations.",
        "start_character": 632,
        "end_character": 736
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001053507-26-000035",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001053507-26-000035-a6616eb675ead252",
        "accession_number": "0001053507-26-000035",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also focused on developing and implementing power solutions across our footprint to help improve the overall efficiency of the communications infrastructure and wireless industries through our power as a service (PaaS) initiatives.",
        "start_character": 22142,
        "end_character": 22380
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001053507-26-000035",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001053507-26-000035-a6616eb675ead252",
        "accession_number": "0001053507-26-000035",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our investment grade credit ratings provide us consistent access to the capital markets and our liquidity provides us the ability to continue to invest in growing and augmenting our business.",
        "start_character": 22854,
        "end_character": 23061
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001053507-26-000035",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001053507-26-000035-a6616eb675ead252",
        "accession_number": "0001053507-26-000035",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that, in certain international markets, we can create value by expanding our existing, communications real estate leasing business, and leveraging our shared global experience, capabilities and services, to deliver a best-in-class offering for our customers and attractive risk-adjusted return for our shareholders.",
